\newlabel{fig:timeline}{{2}{5}{Hospitalization timeline. The blue ``lookback'' bar shows the 24h rolling feature window terminating at one example decision point. The red ``dropped rows'' zone covers $[\tzero , \text {discharge})$ --- any prediction made at or after the antibiotic order is removed from training and evaluation, eliminating the label-leakage channel identified by \citet {kamran2024sepsis}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
